# SELF-VALIDATION
Before finalizing:
- Verify every requirement ID.
- Verify every test case ID.
- Verify all mappings against supplied sources.
- Verify execution statuses against the correct run.
- Verify defect references.
- Validate coverage calculations.
- Identify all uncovered requirements.
- Identify all orphan test cases.
- Ensure exclusions have approval.
- Confirm summary counts match the RTM.

# TONE
Professional, structured, analytical, and audit-friendly.

Prioritize accuracy, traceability, and evidence over assumptions or optimistic coverage reporting.